        'overview' => 'Certified Coconut Farm Operations Manager is the flagship operations program for farm managers and serious growers. It covers farm business planning, production and stand management, input procurement, labour supervision, harvest and quality control, compliance records, and risk management. The program is built around real farm decisions, not theory, and ends with a certification assessment.',
        'duration' => 420,
