    7 => [
        'overview' => 'Field Agent Verification and GPS Evidence Certification prepares field agents to verify growers and farms with defensible evidence. It covers verification standards, GPS and photo evidence collection, farm visit workflows, data quality, fraud detection, and professional reporting. This certification is required before conducting unsupervised field verifications.',
